# Security Rules

## Priority
Security is the highest priority for the client platform because the platform involves online transactions.

## Mandatory protections

- backend-authoritative transaction decisions
- no trust in client-side final state for payments
- no sensitive business state in local storage
- no fake success path in production logic
- all write operations must be validated
- all financial operations must be idempotent where needed
- auditability for sensitive actions

## Client restrictions

- client may render state
- client may request actions
- client may not decide financial truth

## Data handling

- store only the minimum required client state
- never place secrets in frontend code
- never expose admin-only capabilities to client UI
